From: John Stockdale <jstockdale@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Bluetooth: btqca: WCN7860 stock firmware names for iceland

Ours (2026-11-01, C3 radios): load the brh* firmware names the stock
Bluetooth stack ships for this WCN7860 (/lib/firmware/qca). Exit: submit to
Perpetua once the firmware naming is agreed with the Denial project.

Signed-off-by: John Stockdale <jstockdale@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/bluetooth/btqca.c b/drivers/bluetooth/btqca.c
index 7f3358acaa50..4226b204b07d 100644
--- a/drivers/bluetooth/btqca.c
+++ b/drivers/bluetooth/btqca.c
@@ -850,7 +850,7 @@ int qca_uart_setup(struct hci_dev *hdev, uint8_t baudrate,
 		case QCA_WCN7860:
 			config.type = ELF_TYPE_PATCH;
 			snprintf(config.fwname, sizeof(config.fwname),
-				 "qca/gngbtfw%02x.mbn", rom_ver);
+				 "qca/brhbtfw%02x.mbn", rom_ver);
 			break;
 		default:
 			snprintf(config.fwname, sizeof(config.fwname),
@@ -948,7 +948,7 @@ int qca_uart_setup(struct hci_dev *hdev, uint8_t baudrate,
 			break;
 		case QCA_WCN7860:
 			qca_get_nvm_name_by_board(config.fwname, sizeof(config.fwname),
-				 "gngbtnv", soc_type, ver, rom_ver, boardid);
+				 "brhbtnv", soc_type, ver, rom_ver, boardid);
 			break;
 		default:
 			snprintf(config.fwname, sizeof(config.fwname),
